{"study_accession":"PRJNA551394","secondary_study_accession":"SRP212165","title":"Transcriptomic analysis of resting or activated human CD226- and CD226+ effector memory CD8+ T cell subsets isolated from the peripheral blood of healthy donors.","description":"We recently found that loss of the activating receptor CD226 (DNAM-1) was a critical mechanism affecting CD8+ T cell responsiveness to TCR stimulation. To better understand the molecular differences between CD226- and CD226+ CD8+ T cells, we decided to perform a global transcriptional analysis of purified CD226+ and CD226- CD8+ effector memory T cells before and after TCR activation using next generation RNA sequencing. We report here the total RNA sequencing of healthy donor resting CD226- and CD226+ CD8+ Tem cells (n=6/group) or activated (ACT, n=4/group) by α-CD2/CD3/CD28 for 24 hrs. Overall design: Total RNA was extracted using RNeasy Micro kit (QIAGEN) and the sequencing was performed using next generation RNA sequencing","pubmed":"","geo_series":"","n_samples":20,"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN12147161","study_accession":"PRJNA551394","blood_class":"blood_cells","class_from":"sample","title":"Tem CD226-, 22","description":"Tem CD226-, 22","sex":"male","geo_sample":"GSM3908162","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2020-10-31","attributes":[["source_name","peripheral blood"],["tissue","peripheral blood"],["cell_type","CD8+ T cells"],["cell population","Tem CD226-"],["stimulus","Freshly purified"],["date of sample","2016-05-19"],["sex","male"],["age","N.D"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR9606467","experiment_accession":"SRX6370018","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"NextSeq 500","read_count":33146415,"base_count":9571929254,"first_public":"2020-10-31","experiment_title":"NextSeq 500 sequencing: GSM3908162: Tem CD226-, 22 Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"}],"labels":[]},{"sample_accession":"SAMN12147162","study_accession":"PRJNA551394","blood_class":"blood_cells"